      "codex": {
        "event": "Stop",
        "mode": "stop"
      },
      "reason": "The shared process-tree helper recognizes Codex roots; native subagent lifecycle state suppresses false blocking while an agent remains active and is cleared at startup/resume recovery boundaries."
